<ans># Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd — Q1FY26 Financial Data Extraction

## Data Availability Summary

Before presenting the compiled data, a critical sourcing note: the requested primary source URL (`adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/about-us/financials`) resolved to a broken / "Page Does Not Exist" page on the ABHI website — it contains no financial tables or statutory disclosures whatsoever <doc_source>step1web1</doc_source>.

Further, the ABHI "public-disclosure.pdf" / downloads pages on the same domain only host an **archived 31 December 2016** NL-1 through NL-41 statutory return set. No live/updated IRDAI quarterly disclosure for the quarter ended **30 June 2025 (Q1FY26)** could be located at any URL on the company's domain or via search, despite multiple targeted queries (site-restricted searches, exact-phrase searches for "30th June 2025," NL-1/NL-3 filters, etc.) <doc_source>step17web2</doc_source>.

The only genuine Q1FY26 figures for ABHI obtainable from any retrievable document are the **GWP (with/without 1/n), retail/group premium split, revenue, operating expenses, and PBT (with/without 1/n)** disclosed as a comparative column in the "P&L – Aditya Birla Health Insurance" segment table of Aditya Birla Capital's **Q2 FY26 Investor Presentation** (filed 30 Oct 2025 on BSE) <doc_source>step11web3</doc_source>. ABHI does not appear to publish a standalone quarterly investor deck of its own — its results are disclosed only as a segment within the parent company's quarterly presentation.

